        "original_id": "4d3249cc-0256-5430-aa28-128d011b5a7f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Dukes of Hazzard, Moonrunners, Tammy, The Doris Day Show\n- People: Gy Waldron, James Mitchum, Denver Pyle\n- Characters: Briscoe Darling Jr., Grandpa Tarleton, Buck Webb, Uncle Jesse\n- Concepts: adaptation inspiration, shared character names and concepts, bootlegging\n\nFacts:\n- Moonrunners is a 1975 film starring James Mitchum about a Southern family that runs bootleg liquor.\n- Gy Waldron created Moonrunners.\n- The series The Dukes of Hazzard was inspired by the 1975 film Moonrunners.\n- The Dukes of Hazzard and Moonrunners had many identical or similar character names and concepts.\n- Denver Pyle portrayed the character Briscoe Darling Jr.\n- Denver Pyle was known for playing Grandpa Tarleton on Tammy, Buck Webb on The Doris Day Show, and Uncle Jesse on The Dukes of Hazzard.",
