        "text": "Page: The Dukes of Hazzard. Sentence: The series was inspired by the 1975 film \"Moonrunners\", which was also created by Gy Waldron and had many identical or similar character names and concepts.\nPage: Moonrunners. Sentence: Moonrunners is a 1975 film, starring James Mitchum, about a Southern family that runs bootleg liquor.\nPage: Briscoe Darling Jr.. Sentence: The character was portrayed by actor Denver Pyle, best known for his roles as Grandpa Tarleton on \"Tammy\", Buck Webb on \"The Doris Day Show\", and Uncle Jesse on \"The Dukes of Hazzard\".",
